<!DOCTYPE html>
<html class="light" lang="id">
<head>
    <%- include('../partials/head') %>
</head>
<body class="font-sans text-on-surface">

<% var _currentPath = '/santri'; %>
<%- include('../partials/sidebar') %>
<%- include('../partials/topbar') %>

<main class="ml-64 p-8 min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        <div class="mb-6">
            <a href="/santri" class="text-sm text-slate-500 hover:text-primary flex items-center gap-1">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg">arrow_back</span> Kembali ke Data Santri
            </a>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-8">
            <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-2 flex items-center gap-3">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-3xl">upload_file</span>
                Import Data Santri
            </h1>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-6">Upload file CSV untuk mengimpor data santri secara massal.</p>

            <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-xl p-4 mb-6">
                <p class="text-sm text-blue-700 flex items-start gap-2">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg mt-0.5">info</span>
                    <span>Format CSV harus memiliki kolom: <strong>nama_lengkap, jenis_kelamin, tanggal_lahir, nama_ayah, nama_ibu</strong>. Kolom opsional: nis, nisn, tempat_lahir, alamat, no_telepon, email, kelas_id.</span>
                </p>
            </div>

            <form action="/santri/import" method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="space-y-6">
                <div class="border-2 border-dashed border-slate-300 rounded-xl p-8 text-center hover:border-primary transition-colors">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-5xl text-slate-400 mb-3">cloud_upload</span>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-2">Pilih file CSV untuk diupload</p>
                    <input type="file" name="file" accept=".csv" required
                           class="text-sm text-slate-500 file:mr-4 file:py-2 file:px-4 file:rounded-lg file:border-0 file:text-sm file:font-semibold file:bg-primary file:text-white hover:file:opacity-90 cursor-pointer">
                </div>

                <div class="flex justify-end gap-3">
                    <a href="/santri" class="px-6 py-2.5 bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-200 transition text-sm font-medium">Batal</a>
                    <button type="submit" class="px-6 py-2.5 bg-primary text-white rounded-lg hover:opacity-90 transition text-sm font-medium flex items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg">upload</span>
                        Import Data
                    </button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
</main>

</body>
</html>
